      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel that way when everything you valued has been taken from you; the weight of that loss is immense. While the immediate future feels bleak, there are still avenues for rebuilding, even if they are not visible right now. Connecting with support groups or resources for whistleblowers could provide a community understanding what you are facing. Please remember that your inherent worth is not tied to your career or reputation.",
