    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding what? it's not just a job. it's my soul. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person left in there. everything i worked for was built on a foundation that turned out to be rotten, and now i'm just the collateral damage. it feels like the universe is sending a very clear message that there's no place for me here. like i've reached the end of my rope and there's nothing on the other side but more of the same isolation.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
